{
 "title": "Don't Touch The Vase - Part 2",
 "engine": "chatterbox",
 "voice_ref": "kokoro:am_fenrir",
 "tempo": 1.07,
 "lines": [
  {
   "id": "G1",
   "who": "GMA",
   "text": "Before I open this door... blink.",
   "delivery": "old, stern, whisper",
   "exaggeration": 0.5,
   "cfg": 0.5,
   "pause_after": 0.4,
   "voice_ref": "kokoro:af_sarah",
   "tempo": 0.92
  },
  {
   "id": "N01",
   "who": "N",
   "text": "Because the thing from the vase never blinks.",
   "delivery": "low, ominous",
   "exaggeration": 0.55,
   "cfg": 0.5,
   "pause_after": 0.2
  },
  {
   "id": "N02",
   "who": "N",
   "text": "Last night, in Grandma's old house, you broke her vase. Something crawled out, and took your family's voices.",
   "delivery": "fast, tense",
   "exaggeration": 0.55,
   "cfg": 0.5,
   "pause_after": 0.2
  },
  {
   "id": "N03",
   "who": "N",
   "text": "And you chose to grab the pieces and run to Grandma's.",
   "delivery": "tense",
   "exaggeration": 0.5,
   "cfg": 0.5,
   "pause_after": 0.3
  },
  {
   "id": "N04",
   "who": "N",
   "text": "Three streets. In the rain. With a pillowcase full of broken porcelain.",
   "delivery": "fast, breathless",
   "exaggeration": 0.6,
   "cfg": 0.5,
   "pause_after": 0.2
  },
  {
   "id": "N05",
   "who": "N",
   "text": "Behind you, it calls out in Dad's voice.",
   "delivery": "dread",
   "exaggeration": 0.55,
   "cfg": 0.5,
   "pause_after": 0.2
  },
  {
   "id": "D1",
   "who": "DAD",
   "text": "Come home, buddy.",
   "delivery": "flat, cold",
   "exaggeration": 0.4,
   "cfg": 0.5,
   "pause_after": 0.3,
   "voice_ref": "kokoro:am_michael"
  },
  {
   "id": "N06",
   "who": "N",
   "text": "Then, in Mom's voice.",
   "delivery": "dread",
   "exaggeration": 0.55,
   "cfg": 0.5,
   "pause_after": 0.2
  },
  {
   "id": "D2",
   "who": "MOM",
   "text": "Sweetie, you forgot something.",
   "delivery": "sweet, too calm",
   "exaggeration": 0.4,
   "cfg": 0.5,
   "pause_after": 0.3,
   "voice_ref": "kokoro:af_heart"
  },
  {
   "id": "N07",
   "who": "N",
   "text": "Then... in yours.",
   "delivery": "whisper",
   "exaggeration": 0.6,
   "cfg": 0.5,
   "pause_after": 0.2
  },
  {
   "id": "D3",
   "who": "YOU",
   "text": "Don't let her in.",
   "delivery": "flat, eerie whisper",
   "exaggeration": 0.5,
   "cfg": 0.5,
   "pause_after": 0.6,
   "voice_ref": "kokoro:am_puck"
  },
  {
   "id": "N08",
   "who": "N",
   "text": "Lightning. And for one second, you see it on the roofs, keeping up.",
   "delivery": "terror",
   "exaggeration": 0.7,
   "cfg": 0.5,
   "pause_after": 0.4
  },
  {
   "id": "N09",
   "who": "N",
   "text": "You blink. The door opens.",
   "delivery": "relieved, fast",
   "exaggeration": 0.5,
   "cfg": 0.5,
   "pause_after": 0.3
  },
  {
   "id": "G2",
   "who": "GMA",
   "text": "Good. Now give me the pieces. All of them.",
   "delivery": "old, urgent",
   "exaggeration": 0.5,
   "cfg": 0.5,
   "pause_after": 0.3,
   "voice_ref": "kokoro:af_sarah",
   "tempo": 0.92
  },
  {
   "id": "N10",
   "who": "N",
   "text": "She lays them out on the kitchen table. And goes pale.",
   "delivery": "quiet",
   "exaggeration": 0.55,
   "cfg": 0.5,
   "pause_after": 0.3
  },
  {
   "id": "G3",
   "who": "GMA",
   "text": "The face. Where is the face?",
   "delivery": "old, frightened",
   "exaggeration": 0.6,
   "cfg": 0.5,
   "pause_after": 0.3,
   "voice_ref": "kokoro:af_sarah",
   "tempo": 0.92
  },
  {
   "id": "N11",
   "who": "N",
   "text": "Twenty-three pieces. One is missing. The one with the painted face.",
   "delivery": "dread",
   "exaggeration": 0.55,
   "cfg": 0.5,
   "pause_after": 0.3
  },
  {
   "id": "G4",
   "who": "GMA",
   "text": "In nineteen sixty-eight, that thing took my twin brother, Eli. My mother painted every room of our house onto that vase, so it would think the vase was home.",
   "delivery": "old, haunted",
   "exaggeration": 0.55,
   "cfg": 0.5,
   "pause_after": 0.3,
   "voice_ref": "kokoro:af_sarah",
   "tempo": 0.92
  },
  {
   "id": "G5",
   "who": "GMA",
   "text": "Without the face, we can't seal it back in.",
   "delivery": "old, grim",
   "exaggeration": 0.5,
   "cfg": 0.5,
   "pause_after": 0.4,
   "voice_ref": "kokoro:af_sarah",
   "tempo": 0.92
  },
  {
   "id": "N12",
   "who": "N",
   "text": "Then someone knocks. Three slow knocks.",
   "delivery": "whisper",
   "exaggeration": 0.6,
   "cfg": 0.5,
   "pause_after": 1.0
  },
  {
   "id": "E1",
   "who": "ELI",
   "text": "Rosie? It's me. It's Eli. Let me in.",
   "delivery": "child, sweet, eerie",
   "exaggeration": 0.5,
   "cfg": 0.5,
   "pause_after": 0.6,
   "voice_ref": "kokoro:am_puck"
  },
  {
   "id": "N13",
   "who": "N",
   "text": "Grandma's brother would be seventy years old now. That voice... is still twelve.",
   "delivery": "dread, slow",
   "exaggeration": 0.7,
   "cfg": 0.5,
   "pause_after": 1.2
  },
  {
   "id": "N14",
   "who": "N",
   "text": "Go back for the face piece. Let Grandma face it alone. Or open the door for Eli.",
   "delivery": "urgent",
   "exaggeration": 0.5,
   "cfg": 0.5,
   "pause_after": 0.3
  },
  {
   "id": "N15",
   "who": "N",
   "text": "Comment one, two, or three. Part three... if you're still here.",
   "delivery": "low, final",
   "exaggeration": 0.5,
   "cfg": 0.5,
   "pause_after": 0.2
  }
 ]
}